   "function": "The Reference Hybrid: the 13 V reference the entire calibrator's accuracy rests on, stock 893334, and not field-repairable. A ceramic substrate carrying two cascaded 6.5 V temperature-compensated transistor/zener ref amps (U6 and U7 inside the hybrid, which are not this board's U6 and U7) bonded to a thin-film resistor network, held at 62 °C by a heater screened on the back of the substrate. REF13 HI is pin 9, REF13 SENSE pin 12, REF6 pin 14. It also carries the 100 kΩ/30 kΩ divider that makes the 3 V source, the ÷3800 divider for the second channel, the 19.996 kΩ resistor the series linearity circuit works through, and the divider that makes the -127 mV negative offset. The Rev 9 list gives it stock 761338 instead -- see the caveat.",
